---
// 睡眠提升小练习和任务
---
<div class="w-full min-h-[600px] flex flex-col items-center justify-start bg-base-100 pt-8 pb-24 px-4">
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-center">Sleep Tasks</h2>
  <ul class="w-full max-w-md space-y-4">
    <li class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-4 flex flex-col">
      <span class="font-semibold mb-2">冥想 5 分钟</span>
      <span class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-2">帮助放松身心，提升睡眠质量</span>
      <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm self-end">开始</button>
    </li>
    <li class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-4 flex flex-col">
      <span class="font-semibold mb-2">睡前写下 3 件感恩的事</span>
      <span class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-2">积极心态有助于更好入睡</span>
      <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm self-end">开始</button>
    </li>
    <li class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-4 flex flex-col">
      <span class="font-semibold mb-2">减少电子设备使用</span>
      <span class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-2">睡前 30 分钟不看屏幕</span>
      <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm self-end">开始</button>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>
